== Trivia ==
*'''Fafnir''' has no dialogue unless having purchased [[Garlacius]]'s tip. After talking to them, they will no longer give dialogue.
*'''Fafnir''' does, however, display text above their head, as if communicating with the other [[NPC]]s in the {{zone|Shifted Tavern}}.
*'''Fafnir''' is a reference to the dragon of the same name from Norse Mythology.

